{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00810","headline":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 永平舞 · 崔居俭、卢文纪","name":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 永平舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庆传瓒祚，位正瑶图。\n功宣四海，化被八区。\n静彰帝道，动合乾符。\n千秋万祀，永荷昭苏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔居俭、卢文纪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}